ambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T09:07:02-07:00","id":981475,"title":"","content":"So.... I saw in the Monday Meeting Notes the CtD Anthology is in First Draft. Does that mean we will get an announcement soon? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T09:33:46-07:00","id":981488,"title":"","content":"If it's in first draft, the authors have probably already signed their contracts and begun work. I'm excited to see who all got picked!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T09:35:38-07:00","id":981491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/906375-c20-anthology-all-call?p=981488#post981488\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If it's in first draft, the authors have probably already signed their contracts and begun work. I'm excited to see who all got picked!</div> </div> </div> </div>Booo. I haven't heard anything back. <br /> <br /> With my first rejection, I'm a real writer now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T09:43:34-07:00","id":981494,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry! But on the bright side, you're not alone! There was only space for 9 or 10 stories. I think Matt said he had about an order of magnitude more submissions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T09:46:18-07:00","id":981496,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/906375-c20-anthology-all-call?p=981494#post981494\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm sorry! But on the bright side, you're not alone! There was only space for 9 or 10 stories. I think Matt said he had about an order of magnitude more submissions.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I figured it was a long shot. But hey, I got to start somewhere. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Now that I am not waiting on the Anthology, I'm digging out an original sci-fi story I wrote back in 2009. Man, it needs work. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T06:45:00-07:00","id":989323,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/906375-c20-anthology-all-call?p=907088#post907088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">chiimerical, caused By chimera, chimerical weapons or such is the temporary retreat of the Fae soul into the human body... unique in that it leaves a PC a playable charachter<br /> <br /> who willl (Eventually) Revive..<br /> <br /> but someone returning from Chimerical death sounds like a good focus for an story in an anthology.<br /> <br /> other 2<br /> <br /> physical death, When their killed with bullets swords, garou claws, fire, etc<br /> <br /> and Fae death, inflicted with Cold Iron, which destroys their Fae soul.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh one other thing on Chimerical death ive wondered for a bit<br /> <br /> Is it reasonable, for a seelie fae to worry about the Safety of the physical body of a foe they just killed chimericly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.